ex excluding mainly administered prices"}}},"geo":{"label":"Geopolitical entity (reporting)","category":{"index":{"EU27_2020":0,"PT":1},"label":{"EU27_2020":"European Union - 27 countries (from 2020)","PT":"Portugal"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"2025":0},"label":{"2025":"2025"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation).&nbsp;This dataset is compiled according to<span style=\"color: rgb(68, 114, 196);\"> </span>the European Classification of Individual Consumption According to Purpose (ECOICOP) ver. 2, available in base year 2025=100.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>This dataset includes two annual indicators:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the average index, measuring the average of the monthly HICP indices in a calendar year</li><li>the annual average rate of change, comparing the average of the indices over a calendar year to the average of the indices over the previous calendar year.&nbsp;</li></ul>","id":"PRC_HICP_AINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_AINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"10.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2026-01-27T09:34:39+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_AINR\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_AINR</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2026-01-27</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/